   "d": "2021-12-02",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Both divisions have experienced a strong start to the new fiscal year with key demand metrics pointing to a positive outlook.",
   "file": "20211202_OMG_Preliminary-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-02-09",
   "doc": "AGM",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "The Group's current trading performance is in-line with achieving market expectations for the full year ending September 2022.",
   "file": "20220209_OMG_Annual-General-Meeting-Statement.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-06-23",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Our ability to deliver on the buoyant demand has hitherto been impacted by supply chain constraints but looking forward, the situation is gradually improving and the Board believe Oxford Metrics will deliver a performance for the full year in line with achieving market expectations.",
   "file": "20220623_OMG_Interim-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-09-27",
   "doc": "YE-TU",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "CUT",
   "s": -3,
   "q": "However, the global supply chain issues facing the industry have led to the deferment of approximately £3.5m of shipments in the current financial year, and therefore the Board does not now believe the company will meet its full year market expectations.",
   "file": "20220927_OMG_Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-12-06",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "With strong market demand, Vicon start the new financial year with an Order Book of £24.0m which will underpin over half of the full year revenue expectations.",
   "file": "20221206_OMG_Preliminary-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-02-09",
   "doc": "AGM",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": -2,
   "q": "The industry-wide supply chain situation continues to improve and, assuming no unforeseen disruption, the Board remains confident of delivering a trading performance in-line with achieving market expectations for the full year ending September 2023.",
   "file": "20230209_OMG_AGM-Statement.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-06-06",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "RAISE",
   "s": 2,
   "q": "Given this impressive first half performance and visibility of the second half, the Board believes Oxford Metrics is well placed to deliver a full year performance ahead of current market expectations in this year of opportunity and growth.",
   "file": "20230606_OMG_Interim-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-10-25",
   "doc": "YE-TU",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 1,
   "q": "The Group expects to report revenues of £44.0m and an Adjusted PBT* of £6.3m, both ahead of current market expectations* for the financial year.",
   "file": "20231025_OMG_Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-12-05",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "With ongoing market demand, Vicon starts the new financial year with an Order Book of £11.5m which, together with a growing sales pipeline, provides the business with visibility on over a half of expected revenues for the year ahead.",
   "file": "20231205_OMG_Preliminary-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2024-01-31",
